{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "bkash-payment-api-v1",
		"name": "bKash Payment API - Mobile App",
		"description": "Complete bKash Payment Gateway Integration for Mobile App Package Purchase\n\n## Features:\n- Create payment for package purchase\n- Automatic callback handling\n- Payment status checking\n- Transaction search\n\n## Setup:\n1. Set base_url variable to your API URL (e.g., http://localhost/api)\n2. Configure bKash credentials in .env file\n3. Set SANDBOX=true for testing\n\n## Payment Flow:\n1. App calls `/api/bkash/create-payment` with package_id, user_id, amount\n2. API returns bkashURL\n3. App opens bkashURL in webview/browser\n4. User completes payment on bKash\n5. bKash redirects to callback URL\n6. API creates package_history record\n7. Returns success response\n\n## Required Environment Variables:\n- SANDBOX=true\n- BKASH_USERNAME\n- BKASH_PASSWORD\n- BKASH_APP_KEY\n- BKASH_APP_SECRET",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Create Payment",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
							"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
							"    if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.paymentID) {",
							"        pm.environment.set('payment_id', jsonData.data.paymentID);",
							"        pm.environment.set('merchant_invoice_number', jsonData.data.merchantInvoiceNumber);",
							"    }",
							"}"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Accept",
						"value": "application/json",
						"type": "text"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "formdata",
					"formdata": [
						{
							"key": "package_id",
							"value": "1",
							"description": "ID of the package to purchase",
							"type": "text"
						},
						{
							"key": "user_id",
							"value": "1",
							"description": "ID of the user making the purchase",
							"type": "text"
						},
						{
							"key": "amount",
							"value": "1000",
							"description": "Amount to pay (must be >= 1)",
							"type": "text"
						}
					]
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}bkash/create-payment",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}bkash"
					],
					"path": [
						"create-payment"
					]
				},
				"description": "Creates a bKash payment for package purchase.\n\n**Request:**\n- package_id (required): ID of package to purchase\n- user_id (required): ID of user\n- amount (required): Payment amount (min 1 BDT)\n\n**Response:**\n- bkashURL: URL to redirect user for payment\n- paymentID: Payment ID for tracking\n- merchantInvoiceNumber: Unique invoice number\n- callbackURL: Callback URL for payment completion\n\n**Next Step:**\nOpen bkashURL in webview/browser for user to complete payment"
			},
			"response": [
				{
					"name": "Success Response",
					"originalRequest": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{
									"key": "package_id",
									"value": "1",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "user_id",
									"value": "1",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "amount",
									"value": "1000",
									"type": "text"
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}bkash/create-payment",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}bkash"
							],
							"path": [
								"create-payment"
							]
						}
					},
					"status": "OK",
					"code": 200,
					"_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
					"header": [],
					"cookie": [],
					"body": "{\n    \"status\": true,\n    \"message\": \"Payment created successfully\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"bkashURL\": \"https://tokenized.sandbox.bka.sh/v1.2.0-beta/tokenized/checkout?paymentID=TR0011abc123\",\n        \"paymentID\": \"TR0011abc123\",\n        \"merchantInvoiceNumber\": \"PKG_1_1_1699520000\",\n        \"amount\": \"1000\",\n        \"callbackURL\": \"http://localhost/api/bkash/callback\"\n    }\n}"
				},
